      // One page for three files: OWNERS, MODULES and STATICS. The file's entries on the left (the head adds one), the picked entry's fields on the right with its delete. The script names the rows (RzCfgLbl0..7), hides the unused ones and writes the hints; OWNERS adds the tree window picker, MODULES a line of what the module does, STATICS the button that takes the admin's place.
